ep-iteration.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8TwoStepIteration}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8TwoStepIteration}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}two\\text{-}step\\text{-}iteration} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8TwoStepIteration}_S(R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S(R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}two\\text{-}step\\text{-}iteration} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8TwoStepIteration}_S(R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S(R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical predicate defines <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> as the full forcing structure and now carries the set ground model required by its forcing-relation clauses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration.md","status":"resolved","id":"054f5df77a4bd18d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration.md","status":"resolved","id":"054f5df77a4bd18d","anch